#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_basics.rst:8
msgid "Welcome to phpBB's extension development tutorial and documentation."
msgstr "Welcome to phpBB's extension development tutorial and documentation."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_basics.rst:10
msgid ""
"These tutorial pages are based on phpBB's `Acme Demo <https://github.com/"
"phpbb/phpbb-ext-acme-demo>`_ extension. This simple extension demonstrates "
"many common features of an extension, including using a front-controller "
"page, modifying phpBB through core events and template events, modifying the "
"database using migrations, and setting up an ACP module for configuration "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"These tutorial pages are based on phpBB's `Acme Demo <https://github.com/"
"phpbb/phpbb-ext-acme-demo>`_ extension. This simple extension demonstrates "
"many common features of an extension, including using a front-controller "
"page, modifying phpBB through core events and template events, modifying the "
"database using migrations, and setting up an ACP module for configuration "
"settings."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_basics.rst:15
